OL,3,GNEWSAPadel courts offer 'something
OL,4,Acompletely new'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the fastest-growing sports in
OL,7,Fworld, padel, finally arrived on the
OL,8,FIsle of Man last week.
OL,10,FNestled in the centre of Noble's Park
OL,11,Fin Douglas, Manx Padel's six-court
OL,12,Fset-up saw more than 100 people try out
OL,13,Fthe sport at its official opening on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe game, which mixes elements of
OL,17,Fsquash and tennis, is played in doubles
OL,18,Fon a smaller, enclosed court.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
