OL,3,GNEWSAPadel courts offer 'something
OL,4,Acompletely new'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCo-owner Peter Pearce said the project,
OL,7,Fwhich started about two years ago, was
OL,8,Fabout creating a community rather than
OL,9,Fjust offering a new sport.
